# Activity 1: Presentation Design Principles

## 📝 Description
Designed a promotional coffee poster using Canva, featuring a free coffee offer while applying basic presentation design principles such as visual hierarchy, typography, color contrast, and layout alignment.

## 💡 What Have I Learned?
Through this activity, I learned how to create an appealing promotional poster by choosing the right fonts, colors, and layout. I realized that good design is not just about making something attractive but also about making the message clear and easy to understand. I also learned the importance of proper spacing and organizing design elements to avoid a cluttered appearance. These skills can be useful when creating promotional materials, employee engagement posters, and HR announcements in the future.
